OL,3,AUK does not support Trump's Russia
OL,4,Adiesel deal, says Streeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK does not support Donald Trump's
OL,7,Fdeal with Vladimir Putin, which would
OL,8,Fsee the US purchase millions of tonnes
OL,9,Fof diesel from Russia, Defence
OL,10,FSecretary Wes Streeting has said.
OL,12,FSpeaking to BBC Radio 4's Broadcasting
OL,13,FHouse, he said the agreement had been
OL,14,Fdone in the context of the US president
OL,15,Ffacing elections in November and at a
OL,16,Ftime when politicians across the world
OL,17,Fwere under pressure to ease the cost of
OL,18,Fliving.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
